WEBVTT

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:02.970
Joshua...

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.600
You're Joshua, right?

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:17.320
You've gotten taller.
Have you lost a little weight?

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.910
I've been worried about
you this whole time, you know.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.580
Nice to meet you!

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:37.510
My name is Joshua.
I'm waiting here, for my big sister.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:42.640
What are you saying?!
It's me, Rosette! Don't you know me?

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:49.100
I see, what a coincidence.
My big sister's name is Rosette too.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:54.150
So this is what the sibling's reunion is like.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.080
I'm not going to hesitate any more.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.830
Joshua, get back.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:15.840
Shoot. You've wanted to
do that this whole time, right?

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:40.030
It's not right, to point a gun at him.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.580
Joshua!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.340
Lord Joshua...

00:03:56.340 --> 00:04:01.380
Oh, big sister, I can hear the noise again.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:05.260
Someone is calling for me. I wonder who?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.430
You mustn't use your power carelessly.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:10.600
I warned you so many times, and yet...

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:16.900
But that person was going
to shoot Aion. Isn't that horrible?

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:21.400
What? Is she the person that's calling me?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.780
These four years have been long,
haven't they, Rosette Christopher?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:33.080
Joshua needs her,
because he loved his big sister.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:38.710
Joshua, she's tonight's guest of honor.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.630
Be friendly with her.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:50.140
Your dream will soon
be realized. Leave it all to me.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:56.560
You're right, I'll be able to
touch the Astral Line soon.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:01.400
Let's go together, big sister.
We made a promise, right?

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.990
Four years is such a cruel amount of time.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:12.040
You're the one! You're the one
that threw everything into chaos!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.760
I said that this was salvation, didn't I?

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:29.010
Joshua knows who his greatest ally is.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:34.640
How about you finally
throw away that liar's crucifix too?

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.270
It'll make things easier for you.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:43.900
And now, remember
the ache that I carved into you.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:02.090
Oh? Is that supposed to be a warning?

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.760
Aion!

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.720
Hey, are you thirsty?

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.140
I was thinking about going
and buying something to drink.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.980
What?In that case,I'll...

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:22.480
Milady, such a thing
should be done by me.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.150
It's all right. You two wait here.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:32.950
It looks like Miss Satella
has cheered up a little, doesn't it?

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:37.620
Yes, but the fact that milady
has come to show such a gentle side

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:41.040
makes me happier than anything else.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:46.800
This is also thanks to you
and everyone else, Lady Azmaria.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:50.300
Oh, no... I haven't done anything.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.810
I'm sure that because
she encountered your kindness,

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.890
milady was able to become kind as well.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.610
Thank you so very much.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.070
But we didn't do anything at all.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.280
Mr. Steiner?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:40.730
It's so much fun.
It's going to happen soon.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:43.850
You're watching, right?
Aren't you going to stop it?

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.810
Are you okay with it? We're gonna do it!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.110
Whatever happens, it's not my fault.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.210
Steiner! Hold on!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.880
Steiner! Steiner!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.210
Milady...

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.800
What happened?

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:16.680
Forgive me. Lady Azmaria has...

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:22.350
Please hurry,
and please don't worry about me.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.520
Lady Satella...

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.480
Steiner! Steiner!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.150
So you've come.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.880
The horns...

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.760
Let's retreat for a bit, Rosette!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.510
We don't have any weapons,

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.010
and the plans didn't get drawn up in time.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:00.430
This time, they beat us
to the punch, so it's our loss.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.890
Why?! Why are you
saying things like that?

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.690
We should still be able to do something!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.190
Rosette!

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.940
Don't make my four years all for nothing!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.450
Az!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.660
And there you go!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.860
Miasma...

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.060
I understand.

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:35.480
Report this to the Central Council
and to the New York branch.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:43.490
The atonement ceremony?
So they've started.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:48.330
Do you remember, Chrono? Our dream?

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:55.170
That's right, it's begun.
The stars have finally announced the time.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.630
Aion...

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:07.020
Aion! Why are they being so mean?

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.020
They've come here to
take these away from me, right?

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.140
Joshua...

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.860
And if they have, what will you do?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:18.190
This is my power.
I won't let anyone have it.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:24.990
Big sister, stand back.
This time, I'll protect you.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.250
Chrono...

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.680
Chrono!Chrono?

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:48.140
Chrono!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:56.060
What? The noise has stopped.
I don't hear her voice.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:02.570
Aion, it would have been better
if I had killed him sooner, wouldn't it?

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.200
You might be right.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:09.370
Oh, it's coming along nicely!

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:36.860
Head of Pandemonium,

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:40.280
I will be the one to paint
the ending to the Apocalypse.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.860
What did you say?

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.860
It's an emergency communique
from the San Francisco branch.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:13.160
The Astral reactions inside
the city of 'Cisco are still increasing.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.660
They've reached seven
times their normal reaction.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.660
Elder...

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:21.380
Gilliam, advise all
districts to evacuate, right away!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.880
Advise them to evacuate?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:26.050
Elder, what do you mean all districts?

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:29.510
We alone cannot make such a decision.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.350
You're as stiff as ever, Chairman.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.310
It's too late to make a decision
once large-scale panic breaks out!

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:38.270
But we need to allow each related
area the time to follow procedure.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:41.940
At worst, San Francisco
will be wiped off the map.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.520
The Manhattan affair from
before doesn't even compare.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:47.900
It means that an
unprecedented holocaust awaits us.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.570
So it's the Sinners.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.450
Gilliam! It's just as you heard! Hurry!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.410
Yes, Sir!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.950
Elder,could it be that this is...

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.790
They've brought all
of the Apostles together.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.670
Then Azmaria has also...

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.880
Contact Rosette and the others, quickly!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.170
Remington?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.000
What's the matter?

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.470
Up until just now, he was here, but...

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:12.340
The calamity has come,
the calamity has come.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:16.520
Great city, powerful city of Babylon,

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:19.850
your judgment has arrived in an instant.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.540
The soul of atonement...

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:03.230
Seraphim-class reaction confirmed!
It's counterbalancing the miasma!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.270
And the Astral Line?

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.440
It's still up in the sky!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.040
Rosette!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.420
Fi!

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.260
I'm on my way.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.310
A jewel summoner?

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.650
Older sister!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.790
No matter how many times
you warn me, it's meaningless.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.880
Let's see, how are things over here?

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.470
We did it! Ascension!

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:28.520
Rosette!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.360
Rosette...

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:48.540
This ceremony was all
to awaken you, Mary of Magdalene.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:56.010
It is the last remaining of
the seven virtues needed to awaken you.

00:17:56.010 --> 00:18:01.300
The absolute power of Heaven
that devils desire is called justice.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.260
Do you understand?

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:06.270
You're a greater Apostle than your brother.

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:09.940
The power of faith was
necessary in order to bring you up.

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.530
Rosette...

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.570
Kitten, your turn is next.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:35.460
You, who is driven by justice and who has
inherited the love of Mary of Magdalene.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.170
You have murdered
the head of Pandemonium

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.930
and become Mary Who Brings the Light.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:46.520
You're a wonderful treat.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:50.270
You, who embody both justice and love,

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:54.770
use faith to further
unparalleled hate and love.

00:18:54.770 --> 00:19:00.110
You're the same as me.
A destroyer who speaks of salvation.

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:02.240
Release your soul,

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:07.370
cast away your faith
and come to the land of freedom.

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:10.170
That is salvation.
I can do it. Come with me.

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.620
No...

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:15.500
I won't make your four years a waste.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.590
No...

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:58.670
It's the taste of God.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:05.850
Here I go, Rosette. I won't waste your life!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.630
Whoa, Chrono is serious!

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.420
Oh, scary, scary.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:50.560
Mary, be with the Savior.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:54.600
Chrono, kill him!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.150
Aion!
